BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:METAMORPHOSIS XXI
DTSTART:20260710T220000
DTEND:20260710T220000
UID:bcbd7b68d7357920ccf352c79a56d1dd@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the next instalment of the series\, a convergence o
 f all the things we love about our scene and each other\, all wrapped in a
  psychedelic soundtrack by breakout legends. We&#x27\;re absolutely elated
  to welcome rising starlet of the Montreal underground\, a name stuck on t
 he lips of tastemakers from far and wide\, breakcheck. You will not want t
 o miss their Toronto debut. She&#x27\;ll be accompanied by local lovers Mi
 ssion Control and QQ\, known collectively as MC=Q²\, longtime friends of 
 Metamorphosis appearing together behind our decks for the first time. And 
 finaly\, fresh off his big one\, Zellers. The theme is let’s have so muc
 h fun dancing together. The theme is I want to evaporate into a fine cold 
 mist and gather in pools under your eyes. The theme is I can hardly recogn
 ize myself in the mirror because I never dreamed I could become this beaut
 iful. The theme is this was a lovely holiday but I’m ready to come home 
 now. The theme is vehemence. I love you. More than I will ever be able to 
 express. Xo Metamorphosis ‍
LOCATION:141 Bathurst St\, 141 Bathurst St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/metamorphosis-xxi
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
