DESCRIPTION:COME SHAKE A$$ AND CELEBRATE BLACK MAGIC&#x27\;S 1 YEAR ANNIVE
 RSARY ON JULY 11TH!! From the Ghetto pt.ll is a black and queer focused da
 nce party commemorating the underground music genres birthed &quot\;in the
