BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:CLUB LONELY feat. Young Teesh\, PSI\, VJOLLÇA &amp\; Kiki LeFreak
DTSTART:20260711T220000
DTEND:20260711T220000
UID:1db1cdc714124255622d42d6164114ce@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:CLUB LONELY SATURDAY JULY 11TH NEW LOCATION CAFETERIA! THIS MO
 NTH WE ARE EXCITED TO ANNOUNCE OUR GUEST DJS YOUNG TEESH AND PSI “We STA
 N Young Teesh. Her infectious\, positive energy\, dry sense of humour\, va
 mpire-club-vixen style and musical taste have made her one of the city’s
  most exciting DJs just bubbling under the shiny surface of Toronto. She s
 pecialises in club sounds\, rapid-fire beats\, and samples of songs that h
 ave you suddenly finding your feet in the air up against a wall. There is 
 no one like her. She’s respected\, she’s hilarious and she’s damn go
 od.” — Phillippe Villeneuve. Teesh has an affinity for electronic and 
 global club sounds but passionately blends all genres with finesse. She ha
 s played both locally and internationally for the past 9+ years at some of
  the biggest clubs and dance parties around the world including Boiler Roo
 m (London)\, Papi Juice (New York)\, Yes Yes Y’all (Toronto)\, Moonshine
  (Montreal) in places like Germany\, Portugal\, England\, Cuba\, Colorado\
 , Tennessee\, Los Angeles and more. She has worked for an array of corpora
 te clients most notably Havana Club\, Adidas\, Diesel\, the Royal Ontario 
 Museum\, Nike\, Spotify\, Beats by Dre\, Burberry\, Gucci\, Lanvin\, YSL\,
  G-Shock\, On\, Livestock &amp\; Just for Laughs. She has been enlisted to
  play among artists like Nelly Furtado\, Skepta\, Majid Jordan\, Green Vel
 vet\, Bambii\, Chippy Nonstop\, The Blaze\, Floorplan\, Demuir\, Marc Kinc
 hen &amp\; Sara Landry to name a few. Psi is a dynamic force in Toronto’
 s underground music scene—an artist whose work reclaims and reimagines h
 ouse music for a new generation. Known for his bold\, versatile sets that 
 blend house\, techno\, hip hop\, and electronic music\, Psi creates a rhyt
 hmic fusion of the global and the personal. Drawing influence from Latin A
 merica\, the Caribbean\, South Africa\, and the rich musical lineage of th
 e Toronto diaspora\, his sound is as expansive as it is intentional. Start
 ing his DJ journey in 2019\, Psi quickly became one of the most versatile 
 selectors in the city\, spinning at iconic events and festivals like Pep R
 ally\, Promise Cherry Beach\, Smoked\, and For The Lovers. He’s also mad
 e a mark in the ballroom scene and is a resident DJ at Therapy\, the legen
 dary house revival party held at Comfort Zone—cementing his place in Tor
 onto&#x27\;s dancefloor culture. Known for his seamless ability to blend t
 he new with the nostalgic\, Psi’s sets are always a celebration of movem
 ent\, memory\, and liberation. WITH TORONTO’S ICONIC DUO &gt\;&gt\;&gt\;
 &gt\;&gt\;&gt\;&gt\;&gt\;&gt\; GAY SUPER CHARGED SELECTIONS SINCE 2003 &gt
 \;&gt\;&gt\;&gt\;&gt\;&gt\;&gt\; Vjollca @violcayryku and Kiki LeFreak @ki
 kilefreak HOuSE TEcHNo Tickets on Resident Advisor link in bio @kikilefrea
 k Cafeteria 1650 Dupont st 10pm - ??? ‍
LOCATION:Cafeteria\, 1650 Dupont Street
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/club-lonely-feat-young-teesh-psi-vjollca-k
 iki-lefreak
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
