BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Kinky Night Market - Summer Slut Edition
DTSTART:20260712T180000
DTEND:20260712T180000
UID:aae8cd9212d9a44f7563bc0a403fea9f@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Slut Girl (*gender neutral*) Summer! We&#x27\;re ti
 red of AI slop\, queer and kink educators&#x27\; accounts getting screwed\
 , and condos taking over our beloved city. Let&#x27\;s get together over a
  cheeky drink and celebrate our own pleasure. Stop giving your money to bi
 g gross companies. Give it to the creators directly. Get ready for Ontario
 &#x27\;s best kinky and sexy vendors\, raffle prizes\, a bar\, and a place
