UID:2136f9cfab283d832972f3f4b71f5aed@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Come dance around the maypole with us @threedollarbill.parkdal
 e for a Midsommar Queer Sapphic Play Party🌸. Bloom into an evening of s
 un-drenched desire and moonlit mischief at a Midsommar-themed sapphic part
 y celebrating queer hotties🌈. Dancing through the meadow\, flower crown
 s assembled by candlelight\, and a warm\, playful atmosphere where romance
  and flirtation are welcome. Guests are invited to wear floral\, hippy\, l
 inen\, pastels\, flowing dresses\, breezy separates\, lace\, or romantic b
 oho\, with optional body painting at the event. A ceremonial flower crown 
 making station\, dances beneath the lights\, a maypole-themed dance circle
 \, and a plounge draped in garlands💐. 🏳️‍⚧️🏳️‍🌈Thi
 s is a play party exclusively for queer women\, trans\, non-binary\, and t
 wo-spirit folx. You do not have to identify as “sapphic” if it does no
 t fit\, the only limitation on attendance is that cis men are not permitte
 d in the space. CIS MEN ARE NOT PERMITTED TO ATTEND THIS EVENT. We have mo
 re events coming up that will be open to everyone! Follow @salemburnsevent
 s to stay up to date. 🖤Sapphic Play 🖤Dance 🖤DJs 🖤Performances 
